{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "68e973b01458ee1a31d6e6bd457ed42946887dad9b26298782d894c4cf739bb9", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れ様です。\nなんだか気合いが入ってますね？", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。看起来干劲十足呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "550ed3522efeee0fe5730788f9acccff6cc362a99921ccc3c91afbf4db230549", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　お疲れさまです。\nそうなんですよ～、えへへ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生！辛苦了。\n被您看出来了～，诶嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "bbd9020a831d5a1a8b0c3fd54636895a93683f43195f16c946e25340c659fd52", "ja": "春って、新しい出会いの季節だなぁって……。\n色々と楽しいお仕事ができるといいですよね♪", "zh": "春天真的是充满新邂逅的季节呢……。\n要是能接到各种有趣的工作就好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ad97d98218e6e1f6c00be614817d23cef26f05799209b84570f8a9a2f55eeafe", "ja": "そうですね！　アイドルのみんなにとっても。", "zh": "是啊！对偶像们来说也是如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "ce58800b2737e1f4974f41dc6eb46f6165533bf821e4c21c223ad642d829390f", "ja": "あ、そうそう、社長さんがお呼びでしたよ！\nさっそく、新しいお仕事のお話かも？", "zh": "啊，对了对了，社长叫您过去哦！\n说不定是要谈新的工作呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c9aceda493dc29a8776d90dd6b8624a8d8b8537e0e27bb0036d2a9079b6c6b45", "ja": "おっ、ありがとうございます！　もしかして……\n天体公演の話かな？　企画書を出したところなので。", "zh": "哦，谢谢你！难道是……天体公演的事吗？我才刚提交企划书。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "c5baa304eeab0301577cc4ff09676f637f3002fcbf6b1fda6f2319d80bc65ab1", "ja": "えっ、天体公演ですか？　……はっ。\nということは、メンバーは……！", "zh": "诶，天体公演吗？……啊！\n也就是说，成员是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4b033bae517b27dc74d8895714eef3a14a8cb1c57f893a66a984081f6b0e3ea7", "ja": "はい、『765PRO ALLSTARS』のみんなに\n出てもらうつもりです！", "zh": "是的，我打算请『765PRO ALLSTARS』的大家出演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "076b0e8633e33b0ac71cc7f675e3c2d2261a06e00bc2f22dc46b32ff0725c1c2", "ja": "わぁっ、楽しみですね！　どんな衣装がいいかな～？\n……あ、それじゃあ早速！　いってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "哇，真让人期待呢！穿什么样的服装好呢～？\n……啊，那就事不宜迟！路上小心～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1009_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ab9add44bbb7bec02a09a892e4ad754ea28b708379b3422d69e4d6f941c7f56b", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れ様です。\nすっかり新しい仕事の季節ですね！", "zh": "社长、音无女士，辛苦了。\n转眼间又到了新工作的季节了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "5ffdf98811f6c2faf4594bac9e5d9c11360af4c144fa42b73c9049ef19223f86", "ja": "うむ、待っていたよ！　開口一番で仕事の話とは、\n今日もやる気に満ちているね。いや結構結構！", "zh": "嗯，等你很久了！一开口就聊工作的事，\n今天也是干劲十足呢。不错，非常不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "32f54e906cb283bc7cd17e0109cd3e1a92b9f3dbc2b6d177bcfd65e1cc6bc8ed", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}さん。\nまあまあ、まずはお茶でもどうぞ♪", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n来来，先喝杯茶吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6efdf436f8b059406549c62e9e99abbaa31ac8084fe860bf4be41924d2a54ec1", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　ズズズ……。\nふぅ、落ち着きました。", "zh": "谢谢！　吸溜吸溜……。\n呼，平静下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "e9835d87550226ffa1fee04230fd37ec15fcd4c8d8e38feb251764ac84b8d7dd", "ja": "ふふふ、せっかく落ち着いたところ、悪いんだが……\n早速、仕事の話といこう。", "zh": "呵呵呵，好不容易才平静下来，真不好意思……我们马上来谈工作吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "748eea0b0f32327897067e2db12305ec51d00e4988a51df471822f75c11ef504", "ja": "新たな天体公演の企画、読ませてもらったよ。\n素晴らしい！　是非やってくれたまえ。", "zh": "新的天体公演企划，我已经看过了。太棒了！尽管放手去做吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "13da82b30d816877c3eeb0fdfe06bfc39355240a271619a44d238d5098c1e8ba", "ja": "おおっ！　本当ですか？　やった！", "zh": "哦！真的吗？太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "b7fc8588d094731f9af685a8d7e1efeca97265b340e5f812df3a89c62c5a7707", "ja": "『765PRO ALLSTARS』のみんなを、\n3つのチームに分けてのツアー公演……。", "zh": "把“765PRO ALLSTARS”的大家，\n分成3个队伍进行巡回演出……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "41c9b86ec00797bd2be78cb448cab870eb016aae808c465f4f1390bd00771244", "ja": "ふふっ、今度はどんな星空になるのかしら。\nワクワクしてきちゃいますね♪", "zh": "呵呵，这次会呈现出怎样的星空呢？\n真让人期待♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "fc269204d93a70a310f336d8215487b2a1acffd791acff843373caad73369947", "ja": "うむ！　天体公演は、まさに百万の星々のような\n劇場のアイドル達の輝きで、夜空を照らし続けてきた。", "zh": "嗯！天体公演正是以剧场偶像们\n宛如百万繁星般的光芒，不断照亮着夜空。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "2f3db6a84d02cc287b22a5922830d7149728749f938ea881b0f49daae52408d0", "ja": "彼女達ならば、その輝きをしっかり受け止めた上で、\n新たに力強く輝くツアーにしてくれることだろう！", "zh": "如果是她们的话，一定能切实接下这份光芒，\n并将其化作一场焕发全新强劲光芒的巡演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "1397e052ca7a41355a41ca9f31517e1b63170b34e5c5a83f086ed6ab4e3e928c", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\n絶対に、最高の公演になります！　してみせます！", "zh": "谢谢！绝对会成为最棒的公演！我们一定会做到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "c89749c02d3ecb8e6f3b679b7a9fc31f7c2944a2d8342aaba09fadf381f26086", "ja": "その意気だよ、君！　最初のユニットは、\n確か、新たな太陽……『ソル』だったね。", "zh": "就是这个劲头，你！第一个组合，我记得是新的太阳……“Sol”，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "2931ed42256cfaa8e572e3fde7a631779248ba0052d5676869afac8d3ac44c7e", "ja": "双海亜美君、秋月律子君……それから、双海真美君、\n高槻やよい君、星井美希君。うむ、面白くなりそうだ！", "zh": "双海亚美，秋月律子……还有，双海真美，\n高槻弥生，星井美希。嗯，感觉会变得有意思起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "d073796f5ae099e327ad21b84c254a1e6ba4b249a21df2bf9b026b606617c71a", "ja": "はい、ツアーの初陣を、見事に飾ってくれるはずです！", "zh": "没错，她们一定会为巡演的首战献上精彩的表现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "bd1a24f77eec741340e99710f59e5fe04ad567ea0de8b7588527dabf924a3caa", "ja": "{$P$}さん、燃えてますね。\nでは、お茶のおかわりはいかがですか？　社長も。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，干劲十足呢。\n那么，要不要再来一杯茶？社长也请。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "501cb53cffe0a6326ddb3eae1943a082c2896f5e57207711463d864112873c9f", "ja": "ありがとうございます、いただきます！\nズズズ……ふぅ。", "zh": "谢谢，我就不客气了！\n滋溜滋溜……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "216342a79d949f0f70edc0a490b80a6d68061b741a1d6120385723329000988b", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう！　……ふぅ。", "zh": "啊，谢谢！……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "6c663c79b97b94b0d6d05ba502aaa28159b4287ab140aa68eeba630bf9e34fc7", "ja": "（よし！　落ち着き直したところで、\n早速劇場に戻って、細かいプランをつめないとな！）", "zh": "（好！重新冷静下来后，\n得赶紧回剧场，把详细计划敲定才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
